    },
    {
     "id": "PMI-10.R3",
     "text": "Common pressure-drop class: at every W1 test-point flow the cold-flow manifold pressure of every occupant lies within epsilon_p of the PIM-0 value. PIM-0 carries an exchangeable, non-ferromagnetic conductance insert that is set once before P1 so that the blank sits inside the class of the source modules; the setting is frozen with the interface drawing, and changing it creates a new HW-0 reference.",
