   "what": "fixes the module boundary so that the Phase-1 branch outcome (A_extended_hall, B_rf_hall, C_ecr_hall or NO_VIABLE_CASE) is obtained with occupant exchange as the controlled variable on one bus boundary. A conditional statement becomes checkable: 'branch X is the flight propulsion branch provided its Phase-1 comparison was measured through this ICD with every PMI item verified (installation records complete, INV-B3 met, pressure-drop class met, u_inst within budget)'.",
   "next_needed": [
    "owner answers to PMQ-01..PMQ-07 and the linked HWQ items (HWQ-01, HWQ-04, HWQ-05, HWQ-06, HWQ-07, HWQ-12, HWQ-15)",
    "H-1 and module design releases; interface drawing and service-line union frozen before P1",
    "S1a closures (leak, cold flow, B(z) maps, pickup, CD-01/CD-02a, K_s cycles) and S1b (u_inst, S_B, T-SETTLE)",
    "LOCK-1 and LOCK-2 through the existing path",
    "second-lens verification of this lane"
