    "flight configuration of the slot for the hall_only branch",
    "mission closure with all auxiliaries on bus_power_boundary_v1"
   ]
  },
  "three_questions": {
   "i_conditional_selection_now": "none is made; Bundle 1 stays NO_BASELINE_YET; the ICD only makes a branch condition checkable",
   "ii_blocks_physics_backed_selection": "credible Hall set is empty; no measured interface data; inflow gap at HALL_INLET_Z0; single-lens verification",
   "iii_could_overturn": [
    "the ECR magnet cannot meet epsilon_B inside the common envelope (PMI-09)",
